Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:10.04,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who are these...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.45,0:00:13.91,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,{\i1}shadowy soldiers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.81,0:00:39.70,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Where'd they come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.87,0:00:49.00,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,I-Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.15,0:00:51.15,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.15,0:00:53.07,Default,Lim Tae-gyu,0,0,0,,What is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:08.58,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Mr. Song, this means the broadcast \Nwas shut down, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:14.06,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,What in the world is happening over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:20.06,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,It's no good. There's too much \Nconfusion at the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.43,0:01:22.98,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,We need to confirm the status of our hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.25,0:01:25.02,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Gather all the intel we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.02,0:01:25.97,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.91,0:01:29.00,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:32.84,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Calls are coming in so fast that \Nthe phone system is crashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:35.21,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,They're demanding we resume the broadcast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.21,0:01:37.03,Default,Director,0,0,0,,We would if we could!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.03,0:01:40.45,Default,Director,0,0,0,,But we're not getting any word from \Nthe scene, much less any footage!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:45.87,Default,Director,0,0,0,,{\i1}Besides... What do we do \Nif all the S-Ranks are dead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.23,0:01:51.63,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Hey, answer me! \NWhat is going on over there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.25,0:01:55.76,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Damn it! Camera's not working...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:57.36,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Now, of all times!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.22,0:01:59.03,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:08.54,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.89,0:02:21.79,Default,Ma Dongwook,0,0,0,,I'm not following any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.38,0:02:24.42,Default,Ma Dongwook,0,0,0,,Just who are those shadows?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:28.14,Default,Ma Dongwook,0,0,0,,And how is Hunter Sung even here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.94,0:02:33.61,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung! When did you get to the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:35.53,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,And how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.53,0:02:36.82,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.18,0:02:39.57,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,First, let's treat your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.57,0:02:40.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Drink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.77,0:02:46.08,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, I can't transfer these...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:50.40,Default,Ma Dongwook,0,0,0,,Some sort of medicine? From summoning magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:51.54,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mr. Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:54.75,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Please open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:00.54,Default,Ma Dongwook,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:07.66,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,My wounds... They're healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:17.61,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,She's not recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:19.40,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Why isn't it working?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:23.58,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's just like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:27.34,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not good. Her aura is getting \Nweaker and weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.32,0:03:31.01,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,She's too badly hurt for me to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:33.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here, fast. \NI'll clear a path.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.97,0:03:34.71,Default,Ma Dongwook,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:35.74,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.75,0:03:43.00,Default,Lim Tae-gyu,0,0,0,,They swarm just like bugs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.00,0:03:45.39,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,There's just too many!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:50.85,Default,Associates,0,0,0,,Chairman!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.85,0:03:52.68,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,What condition is the strike team in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:53.99,Default,BG Associate A,0,0,0,,We're still unsure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.99,0:03:57.61,Default,BG Associate A,0,0,0,,Something has temporarily interrupted \Nall comms from the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.05,0:04:01.73,Default,BG Associate B,0,0,0,,We've been trying to contact Japanese \Ncommand, but we can't get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.73,0:04:06.17,Default,BG Associate C,0,0,0,,The civilian media hasn't seen anything \Nsince the black ant appeared, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:08.97,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,We need to restore signal as soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:12.63,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Make sure the medic and retrieval teams \Nare ready to move ASAP!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:13.71,Default,Associates,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:18.83,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,I have never...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:23.71,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,resented my aging body and heart \Nas much as I do right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:29.09,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Even if I couldn't help, \NI wish I could fight at their sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.01,0:04:31.31,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Chairman...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.73,0:04:35.47,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Please, let them be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:41.32,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Ugh! What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:47.20,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,First the feed cuts, and now \Nthe TV breaks?! Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:49.75,Default,Park Kyunghye,0,0,0,,I don't think that's helping, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.75,0:04:52.31,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,I'm gonna watch in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:56.13,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Maybe I can find some updates on my phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.50,0:05:01.34,Default,Park Kyunghye,0,0,0,,Such a restless girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.47,0:05:05.16,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is happening? Explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:07.97,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0,0,0,,Goto's vital signs are silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:11.27,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0,0,0,,From what we can tell \Nbefore the signal was cut,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:14.09,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0,0,0,,there was a powerful enemy that appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.09,0:05:15.84,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0,0,0,,It's likely he was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.51,0:05:17.68,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,{\i1}And the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:19.68,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0,0,0,,We're in the process of verifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:21.35,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, make it fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.35,0:05:24.03,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Any further losses will cost us \Nin the next phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:26.41,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:35.19,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,Goto got himself killed? The useless oaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:38.90,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,What in the hell is happening on that island?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.98,0:05:50.68,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Elites like Igris and Iron \Nare doing well enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:53.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the foot soldiers are \Nat a bit of a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:06:00.07,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Part of me wants to boost their numbers, \Nbut with this many people watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.04,0:06:02.26,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.26,0:06:03.45,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.35,0:06:06.10,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This isn't getting us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.10,0:06:08.83,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm going to get a bit more aggressive \Nabout clearing our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.83,0:06:10.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The rest of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:13.28,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Please stay behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:16.34,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The other shadows will fight off the ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:21.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Should any get past, please deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:24.87,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Understood. We can still handle that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.87,0:06:25.92,Default,Lim Tae-gyu,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:30.96,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And I also need to ask you: please keep \Nwhat you're about to see to yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:33.35,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Is he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.44,0:06:57.67,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,He's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.67,0:06:59.37,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:01.58,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,that Goto lost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.62,0:07:22.25,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,There was no king outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.82,0:07:24.48,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,Is he in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:27.75,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,The one you would call king?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:34.12,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's the reason I can't sense \Nthe shadow I sent with Goto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.79,0:07:35.78,Default,Lim Tae-gyu,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:36.91,Default,Ma Dongwook,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:07:58.10,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,Is it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:08:01.09,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,Are you the king of humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.32,0:08:04.59,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.97,0:08:07.26,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Fancy that. A talking bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:09.57,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,Human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.02,0:08:14.24,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,What a powerful aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.78,0:08:23.84,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But you're still just a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:26.67,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Even for Hunter Sung...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:28.61,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,This might be too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:36.01,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,Director! We've got the feed back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:37.47,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.47,0:08:38.97,Default,Director,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.94,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Resume the broadcast! Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.45,0:08:45.72,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,But if we do that, we'll be \Nbroadcasting live with no delay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:48.59,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,If something happens, we won't \Nbe able to stop it getting out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.59,0:08:52.25,Default,Director,0,0,0,,We already cut the broadcast once. \NI don't see how it can get worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.25,0:08:53.08,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:54.14,Default,Staff B,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.75,0:08:59.02,Default,Staff B,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our fate—no, the outcome of this battle—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:01.06,Default,Staff B,0,0,0,,{\i1}depends on this man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:03.31,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,M-Mr. Song!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.31,0:09:04.54,Default,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I can't believe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:06.49,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:15.28,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,No way! How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:17.76,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Jinwoo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:19.92,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,He said he was just stepping out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.85,0:09:22.73,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Again with this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:27.94,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:32.15,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,But how did he get to the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:34.43,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,I wouldn't worry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:37.00,Default,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Let's put our faith in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:52.92,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,If he's a mage type, \Nwhy would he get so close?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:54.99,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,He underestimated the ant...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.99,0:09:57.51,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,and got nailed for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.10,0:09:59.65,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,Weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.65,0:10:01.33,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,You must not be the king after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.03,0:10:27.39,Default,Ma Dongwook,0,0,0,,Master Baek. Master Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.19,0:10:30.78,Default,Ma Dongwook,0,0,0,,Is he really a mage?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.78,0:10:33.17,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,I have no idea anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.64,0:10:35.79,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,I certainly wasn't expecting this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:40.22,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's pretty durable. Is it the exoskeleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:11:00.53,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a fearsome battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.53,0:11:03.16,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm an A-Rank, and it's all \NI can do to stay on my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:08.29,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,{\i1}The flow of magic power is enough \Nto almost make me pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.48,0:11:16.67,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm being... forced back?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:29.60,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.81,0:11:32.69,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}What in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:36.42,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}is this human?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.06,0:12:03.32,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:07.28,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,A mixture of toxins from \Nmarine life in this area,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:10.49,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,with my magic power amplifying its potency.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.49,0:12:12.94,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,You should no longer even be able to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.87,0:12:18.14,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,This is the end for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:23.74,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,Die, human!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:32.07,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,Seven KIA in a ten-man team? \NIs this some kind of joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.07,0:12:34.04,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, sir, it's the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.04,0:12:38.20,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0,0,0,,{\i1}We were able to contact \Nthe surviving hunters to confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:44.60,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,We lost over half our hunters?! \NThis is a fiasco!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:49.54,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0,0,0,,We've also detected a powerful reading \Nnear the island's caldera.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:52.52,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0,0,0,,It's likely the magic beast that defeated Goto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.52,0:12:55.30,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,{\i1}How is it still alive after fighting him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:57.97,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,{\i1}And it's headed into the nest? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.97,0:13:01.22,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0,0,0,,There's no telling. \NIt could have some objective,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:03.53,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0,0,0,,{\i1}or maybe it was injured enough \Nto want to return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.46,0:13:08.41,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,{\i1}We weren't able to confirm \Nthe survival of the Korean hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:12.69,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,{\i1}If they're still alive, they're going to run \Ninto that thing that was able to kill Goto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.69,0:13:15.08,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no way they can win \Nwhen they're already exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:17.92,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,{\i1}The ants will be weak \Nfrom all the fighting, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.41,0:13:23.15,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we can strike down the strong one, \Nthe others will just be fodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:26.30,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,{\i1}We can still come out of this on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:29.58,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,Hurry and recover the survivors!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:34.56,Default,Matsumoto Shigeo,0,0,0,,As soon as they've joined the second strike \Nteam at sea, send them back to the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.45,0:13:39.09,Default,Sugimoto Reiji,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that about covers it. A chopper \Nwill be there to pick you up shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:40.96,Default,Tawata Kanae,0,0,0,,Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.04,0:13:46.16,Default,Tawata Kanae,0,0,0,,We're moving to plan 9. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:47.65,Default,Hoshino Minoru,0,0,0,,It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.58,0:13:50.81,Default,Hoshino Minoru,0,0,0,,That thing... is a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:53.89,Default,Hoshino Minoru,0,0,0,,We don't... stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.65,0:13:57.58,Default,Tawata Kanae,0,0,0,,Get a grip! We don't have time \Nfor panic attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.58,0:14:00.22,Default,Hoshino Minoru,0,0,0,,No one can beat that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:03.25,Default,Hoshino Minoru,0,0,0,,We need to run! If we don't, we'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:06.38,Default,Tawata Kanae,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:09.94,Default,Tawata Kanae,0,0,0,,And we don't have a choice, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.27,0:14:34.99,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Wasn't he poisoned? Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.12,0:14:39.08,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,At this point, nothing can surprise me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:42.32,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,So you had a secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:46.38,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No wonder you seemed \Nto be taking it easy earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:52.69,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe it's because my perception ability \Nhas gotten so high...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.69,0:14:54.79,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I can sense his feelings—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:56.89,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}his anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.95,0:14:59.82,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, that makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.81,0:15:05.51,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to end this as soon as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:20.25,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}Poison is ineffective. \NTests of strength are pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:22.07,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.03,0:16:38.83,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}Speed comparable to my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.65,0:16:42.40,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}And yet, he grows even faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:45.52,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:48.42,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Upgrade... Mutilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.17,0:17:54.78,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wha... What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.78,0:18:00.83,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:06.40,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Regeneration, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.59,0:18:09.08,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.56,0:18:13.67,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}What in the world was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.37,0:18:41.95,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just who... is this human?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:46.08,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,This human!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.93,0:18:50.90,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:16.61,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.41,0:19:21.17,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was born to be the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.17,0:19:28.27,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}I devour all, growing ever more powerful...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:32.43,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should be king. And yet now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:36.24,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}Run...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:38.74,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.45,0:19:43.41,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must run to survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:49.31,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}To get as far away as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.77,0:20:10.06,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:12.12,Default,Ant King,0,0,0,,{\i1}I must hurry and get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.34,0:20:46.82,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,The ants...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:48.45,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,They're fleeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.45,0:20:49.82,Default,Lim Tae-gyu,0,0,0,,Did we win?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:20:54.57,Default,Ma Dongwook,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.34,0:21:04.71,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her aura is fading... \NWe're almost out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.71,0:21:06.29,Default,Baek Yoonho,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:08.79,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,A recovery helicopter \Nshould be waiting outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:09.76,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,If we can get on board—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.76,0:21:12.29,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No. I'm not sure she'll last that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:13.79,Default,Lim Tae-gyu,0,0,0,,Then what do we—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.55,0:21:19.55,Default,Ma Dongwook,0,0,0,,I thought potions didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:21.22,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I haven't tried this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:29.39,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Elixir of Life that cured \NMom's Eternal Sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.77,0:21:33.05,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is our last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.83,0:21:38.86,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's ineffective?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:43.05,Default,Ma Dongwook,0,0,0,,Did it not work?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:47.83,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leaving the island normally won't be \Nfast enough. Potions aren't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.83,0:21:51.01,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I need more time before \NI can use Shadow Exchange again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.05,0:21:55.70,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is there... nothing else I can do?
